  consentTitle: Use a selfie?
  consentBody: 'GlowUp reads the colour of the skin in the middle of one photo to
    suggest a skin tone. The photo is kept small in your profile on this phone only:
    it is not sent to the AI or to the database. You can delete it at any time, and
    the suggestion is yours to change.'
  consentAgree: I agree
  consentCancel: Cancel
  msgGuide: Face the window or a lamp, take off glasses, and keep your face in the
    middle. Then tap Take photo.
  msgNoCamera: The camera is not available. Allow it in the phone settings, or choose
    the tone yourself.
  msgResult: 'Your skin looks like {0}. It is selected for you: change it if it does
    not look right.'
